    "title": "Colleton County School District To Offer Law Enforcement Course - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago Law Enforcement Services courses will begin being offered in the fall semester at Thunderbolt Career and Technology Center. The program, part of the South Carolina Department of Education’s Law, Public Safety, Corrections, and Security career cluster, is offered as a result of a collaboration between Colleton County School District, the City of Walterboro management, and Colleton County officials. Read full article",
